# ============================
# Unreal Engine 5 - Generated/Cache folders
# ============================
Binaries/
Build/
DerivedDataCache/
Intermediate/
Saved/
.vs/
.vscode/
.idea/

# ============================
# Plugin binaries
# ============================
# Plugin Binaries/ are tracked on purpose: some binaries in NonScriptedDialog
# are prebuilt/vendored and are NOT recompiled from source on each machine.
# Do NOT ignore Plugins/*/Binaries/ - only ignore build intermediates.
Plugins/*/Intermediate/

# ============================
# Unreal Engine 5 - Generated project files
# ============================
*.VC.db
*.opensdf
*.opendb
*.sdf
*.sln
*.suo
*.xcodeproj
*.xcworkspace

# ============================
# Local LLM model files (Llama-Unreal / GGUF)
# ============================
# GGUF models are large binaries and shouldn't be versioned in git.
# Document download links/instructions in the README instead.
*.gguf
Saved/Models/

# NOTE: previously "*.bin" was ignored globally, which risked catching
# required non-model binaries too. Scope it to the models folder instead.
Saved/Models/*.bin

# ============================
# ThirdParty binaries (llama.cpp)
# ============================
# These ARE required to run the plugin and are not rebuilt from source
# on every machine, so they must stay tracked in git (ideally via Git LFS -
# see .gitattributes). Do NOT ignore these folders.
# ThirdParty/LlamaCpp/Lib/
# ThirdParty/LlamaCpp/Binaries/

# ============================
# OS-specific junk files
# ============================
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# ============================
# Packaging/build output
# ============================
Saved/StagedBuilds/
Saved/Cooked/

# ============================
# Miscellaneous
# ============================
*.log
*.tmp